text = "Wega is constantly chasing you, and so he must be constantly kept track of. Luckily, since his behaviour is so basic, it's rather easy to keep track of him.

On top of that, he also has varying tells on how close-by he is, such as the red/purple light he emits and the sound he constantly plays."

