theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 16
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Wega is the main threat of the game, but, by himself, he's extremely easy to avoid (his chase in the tutorial should be proof of that).

This is because Wega is most dangerous when there's other things pressuring you, such as the threat of falling, the need to rack up points or other enemies.

The idea for \"STYLE\" came as a result of me adding jumping and dashing to Xetheon's port of Wega's Challenge to Godot. I found that juking around Wega with a dash was fun, and I wanted to incentivize doing so. I had also recently played ULTRAKILL, which was (and still is) a very big source of inspiration for this game's design."

